WEBVTT

00:14.154 --> 00:21.397
The cameras flash, the questions start to blur I

00:21.477 --> 00:26.179
smile and nod, playing the character

00:29.060 --> 00:34.742
But underneath the makeup and the lights I'm

00:34.822 --> 00:41.005
terrifyingly alone on these high wire nights

00:43.743 --> 00:48.248
Until I catch your eye across the room

00:50.891 --> 00:55.756
And suddenly I'm safe inside this tomb

00:58.999 --> 01:03.155
You never have to wear the mask for me I know

01:03.215 --> 01:06.938
exactly who you wanna be When the oxygen gets

01:07.018 --> 01:11.842
thin up on the stage I'll be the one to open up the

01:11.942 --> 01:17.126
cage Just breathe and let the heavy armor fall

01:17.246 --> 01:23.971
I've got you and your back is to the wall

01:32.033 --> 01:39.917
Who sees me clear When everything I am begins to

01:39.977 --> 01:45.880
disappear And you're the melody I've always

01:46.020 --> 01:51.662
known I'll never let you face the dark alone

01:55.764 --> 02:01.967
You're my safe person The calm inside the storm

02:03.428 --> 02:11.795
The only place I know where I am warm We tear down

02:12.055 --> 02:16.479
all the idols and the lies And find the truth

02:16.559 --> 02:20.582
inside each other's eyes No electric amps, no

02:20.723 --> 02:26.567
flashing lights Just you and me Surviving all

02:26.587 --> 02:27.148
the night

02:32.480 --> 02:36.424
You're my safe person

02:37.866 --> 02:38.326
Always

